!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Cells from Usp22fl/fl/Foxp3-YFPCre and WT (Foxp3-YFPCre) mice were not grown in culture. YFP+ Tregs were FACS sorted and immediately fixed for ChIP. For cells with acute loss of Usp22 or Rnf20 by Cas9 RNP editing, FACS sorted GFP+ Tregs were cultured in DMEM, 10% FBS, 1% pen/strep + 2000U hIL-2 in 24 well plates at 1 million cells/mL. Tregs were stimulated using CD3/CD28 Mouse T-Activator Dynabeads (Thermo Fisher, Cat# 11456D) at a ratio of 3:1 beads to cells for 48 hours. Cells were split and media was refreshed every 2-3 days.
